    <description>Package includes win-x64 and win-x86 dynamic libraries

Intel OpenMP* Runtime Library provides OpenMP API specification support in Intel® C Compiler, Intel® C++ Compiler and Intel® Fortran Compiler. It helps to improve performance by creating multithreaded software using shared memory and running on multi-core processor systems.</description>
